# The test code inherits the checks of the root configuration and switches off
# exactly one of them (issue #45).
#
# bugprone-unchecked-optional-access cannot see through QTest: every
# dereference in the tests is guarded by QVERIFY(x.has_value()), which returns
# from the test function on failure, but the dataflow analysis only sees an
# opaque call to QTest::qVerify() and reports all of them. Measured on
# 01.08.2026: 52 of 72 findings came from this one check, all of them guarded.
# In src/ the check stays on, where a plain `if (!x)` guard is understood.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-bugprone-unchecked-optional-access'
